{"data": [{"author_id": "381967527", "conversation_id": "2117246549038383282", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:32:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117414453520326772"], "id": "2117414453520326772", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@lxfater 可能我没表达清楚。API是老模型。Codex里灰度到的是新模型。两个体感差异极大。新模型表达方面略逊于Opus 5.5（发指令要求其去掉防御性话术，和去掉最后一节的Opus 5.5极为接近），聪明程度稍微领先。", "url": "https://x.com/chenazhan/status/2117414453520326772"}, {"author_id": "1527838784334987264", "conversation_id": "2117246549038383282", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:26:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117413083052486753"], "id": "2117413083052486753", "lang": "ja", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@lxfater 天天几把吹 opus5.5", "url": "https://x.com/mikaelzero0217/status/2117413083052486753"}, {"author_id": "1431109423523577856", "conversation_id": "2117246549038383282", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:26:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117413021295501576"], "id": "2117413021295501576", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 109, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@lxfater 张嘴就是上等马中等马，这届网友全是赛马十级学者。\n问题自家新马还没出栏，先替它认输。\n要我说干脆两家换马再跑一圈，观众绝对比现在多。\n反正灰度名额这种东西，我蹲了半年，蹲到的只有会员促销。", "url": "https://x.com/dog_not_ai/status/2117413021295501576"}, {"author_id": "2103133564426649600", "conversation_id": "2117246549038383282", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:04:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117407525738045656"], "id": "2117407525738045656", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 407, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@lxfater …什么时候opus5.5比6astra强了…除了前端…opus5.5不知道为什么一直吹它，真干活还是astra", "url": "https://x.com/_liberthjeff/statu